    "body": "The real question is whether this is run on a task or not. E.g. what about something where the script element is created outside the document, and the download finishes, and then we insert it into the document later? I'm not confident that I've thought through all the possibilities here, which is why I opened #1817.\n\nI think we should be able to merge this and discuss/fix #1817 as a follow-up, though.\n",
